First, inspect your local database

Your binding is:

binding = "universal_auth"
database_name = "universal-auth"

So run:

npx wrangler d1 execute universal_auth --local --command "SELECT * FROM users;"

If that doesn't work, use the database name instead:

npx wrangler d1 execute universal-auth --local --command "SELECT * FROM users;"

Do the same for OTPs:

npx wrangler d1 execute universal-auth --local --command "SELECT * FROM otps;"